[openart][target][stderr]  
[openart][target][stderr] -Sample configurations for internal microservices.
[openart][target][stderr] \ No newline at end of file
[openart][target][stderr] +This repository contains sample configuration files for internal microservices and applications. These samples are intended to help onboard new developers by providing realistic examples of configuration patterns used across our infrastructure.
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +## Purpose
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +- **Onboarding**: Help new developers understand our configuration patterns
[openart][target][stderr] +- **Reference**: Provide examples of how different services are configured
[openart][target][stderr] +- **Consistency**: Maintain consistent configuration patterns across teams
[openart][target][stderr] +- **Documentation**: Supplement official documentation with practical examples
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +## Repository Structure
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +- `config_sample.env` - Sample environment configuration for a microservice
[openart][target][stderr] +- Additional configuration samples will be added as needed
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +## Usage
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +1. Clone this repository
[openart][target][stderr] +2. Review the sample configurations
[openart][target][stderr] +3. Use them as references when setting up new services
[openart][target][stderr] +4. Never commit actual credentials or sensitive data to this repository
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +## Contributing
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +If you have configuration patterns that would be helpful for other teams, please submit a merge request with:
[openart][target][stderr] +- A clear description of what the configuration demonstrates
[openart][target][stderr] +- Anonymized/mock values (no real credentials)
[openart][target][stderr] +- Context about which service or use case it applies to
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +## Security Note
[openart][target][stderr] +
[openart][target][stderr] +All values in this repository are mock/example values. Never use these credentials in production environments. Always follow your team's security guidelines for managing actual configuration values.
